DESCRIPTION:Officine Brera is the new hub for music and culture in Helsink
 i. Under the artistic direction of Alessandro D’Anna the new venue hosts
  musicians from all around the world. Busy music program\, amazing italian
  food and wine\, unique cocktail bar\, Officine Brera is a new experience 
 in Helsinki.\n\n30.05. Brazil\nMaré Alta Group\n\nReserving your table fo
 r the food experience is highly suggested to support the music\, no ticket
  fee is requested. Main hall is dedicated to the food experience while res
 ervation for the bars are for mostly drinks\, walk in is also welcome!\n\n
 https://v2.tableonline.fi/instabook/bookings/jDtOPML/selection
